    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dropcore</i></strong>\u00a0is a fast-paced 2D multiplayer arena game focused on physics-based knockback combat. There\u2019s no health \u2014 only chaos, gravity, and pure skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class, grab your pistol, and dive into unpredictable battles where your only goal is to throw your enemies off the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map has unique gameplay mechanics:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Custom gravity settings  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dynamic wind forces  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Speed and jump modifiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and collect a wide range of weapon classes \u2014 from pistols to shotguns to experimental tech \u2014 each with different recoil, fire rate, and knockback strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick both passive and active abilities to match your playstyle: dash through enemies, rewind time, launch shockwaves and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 6 game modes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Supports 2\u20134 players per match  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Strategic wepaon class + skill system  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Play with friends via direct Steam invite  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love chaotic PvP, physics-based mayhem, and outplaying opponents with movement \u2014 <strong><i>Dropcore</i></strong> is your next addiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dropcore</i></strong>\u00a0is a fast-paced 2D multiplayer arena game focused on physics-based knockback combat. There\u2019s no health \u2014 only chaos, gravity, and pure skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class, grab your pistol, and dive into unpredictable battles where your only goal is to throw your enemies off the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map has unique gameplay mechanics:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Custom gravity settings  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dynamic wind forces  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Speed and jump modifiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and collect a wide range of weapon classes \u2014 from pistols to shotguns to experimental tech \u2014 each with different recoil, fire rate, and knockback strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick both passive and active abilities to match your playstyle: dash through enemies, rewind time, launch shockwaves and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 6 game modes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Supports 2\u20134 players per match  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Strategic wepaon class + skill system  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Play with friends via direct Steam invite  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love chaotic PvP, physics-based mayhem, and outplaying opponents with movement \u2014 <strong><i>Dropcore</i></strong> is your next addiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
